invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser_ext.c
catches: srv_test
reason: take_share holds a key_exchange to at least CH_KEX_CLIENT_SHARE bytes
  rather than exactly that many, so a 33-byte x25519 share is handed to
  the key exchange, which reads 32 of them and agrees on a key the
  client computed from different bytes. srv_parser.h fixes the length,
  and test/srv_parser_tests.h requires illegal_parameter one byte over
  it as well as one byte under.

--- old
    if (share_len != CH_KEX_CLIENT_SHARE) {
--- new
    if (share_len < CH_KEX_CLIENT_SHARE) {
